# Authentik → OpenProject OIDC

Create an Authentik application + provider for OpenProject.

Typical redirect URI (relative URL root `/project-management`):

```
https://<company-domain>/project-management/auth/oidc/authentik/callback
```

(Exact callback path depends on OpenProject OpenID Connect provider slug — confirm in Admin → Authentication → OpenID providers after creating the provider named `authentik`.)

```bash
OIDC_DISPLAY_NAME=Authentik
OIDC_ISSUER=https://<company-domain>/auth/application/o/openproject/
OIDC_CLIENT_ID=...
OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET=...
```

ERP keeps its own Authentik client (`AUTHENTIK_*` on the Next.js app). Shared login is IdP-level SSO, not a shared cookie between ERP and OpenProject.
